ML model for molten MgCl2 generated using DeepMD-kit. it describes the molten MgCl2's PES in the 1000-1600 K temperature range. Training, validation and testing data generated by AIMD simulations across the full temperature range in VASP. The input file for training and the datasets used are also uploaded.

More details on the training, the testing and the use of this model for the calculation of thermal and structural properties of molten MgCl2 can be found at https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.30549.